<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="2.6">
  <book code="2TH" style="id">- Makua Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">2 Attu o Uthesalonike</para>
  <para style="toc1">Iwarakha yo nayelhi i Napaolo wa attu o Uthesalonike</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Attu o Uthesalonike</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 Uthes</para>
  <para style="mt2">Iwarakha yo nayelhi i Napaolo wa</para>
  <para style="mt1">Attu o Uthesalonike</para>
  <para style="imt">Malhove o uholhelha</para>
  <para style="ip">Iwarakha yo nayelhi i Napaolo wa attu o Uthesalonike yaalhepiye ni akarumiya Napaolo (nlhako wo 1:1). Anolhepa iwarakha ilha wo makhuvi baada yo iwarakha yo upachera, iyaakha yo 51 baada yo uyaria wa Kuristo. Napaolo yaalhempe iwarakha yo nayelhi wa nlhoko wa attu anrumelhenlhe Kuristo o Uthesalonike, bado anari Ukorintho. Nlhoko waachokhonlhe aya mu nkwaha aya wo nayelhi wo uhimiacha Malhove Orera (Mitk nlhako wo 17:1-10). Nhina ikitabu yo Mitheko cha akarumiya ihohimiya wiira nlhoko uyo wo uthakania akina Ayahudi ni akina Ayunani enchi.</para>
  <para style="ip">Nlhoko wa attu anrumelhenlhe Kuristo wo Uthesalonike, waakurumichiye uvarechesha mwaha wo mahuku o umalhelha ilhapo ni uwa wo nayelhi wa Kuristo ukhalhawaya Napaolo aholhepa malhove menchi nhina iwarakha chaya pilhi wa attu o Uthesalonike chiyo. Kharibu nusu yo iwarakha yo nayelhi wa attu o Uthesalonike, inohimiacha mwaha unaacha nihuku no umalhelha ilhapo. Tho, Napaolo anowaamuka attu ahiye ureshi, kila ntu avareke ntheko awe mwanene wiira apatte yolhia awe (nlhako wo 3:6-10).</para>
  <para style="iot">Chiri nhina</para>
  <para style="io">Napaolo anochokholha iwarakha wo wiihimiacha anene ni ashikhunanaya (nlhako wo 1:1-2).</para>
  <para style="io">Anonshukhuru Nlhuku wo nlhatu wo nlhoko wa attu anrumelhenlhe Kuristo o Uthesalonike ni waalhapelhelha (nlhako wo 1:3-12).</para>
  <para style="io">Nlhako wo 2, Napaolo anohimiacha mwaha wo mahuku o umalhelha ilhapo. Tho, anohimiacha mwaha wo attu ahiye ureshi, avareke mitheko (nlhako wo 3:1-15).</para>
  <para style="io">Napaolo anomalhiha wo urweeha isalamu tho wa attu anrumelhenlhe Kuristo (nlhako wo 3:16-18).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Mii Paolo vamoka ni Nasila ni Natimotheo, ninoolhepa iwarakha wa nlhoko wa attu anrumelhenlhe Kuristo o Uthesalonike arii attu a Nlhuku Athumwanihu ni a Athithi Yesu Kuristo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>Ninoulhapelhelhani nnema ni mpuha ukhuma wa Nlhuku Athumwanihu ni Athithi Yesu Kuristo.</para>
  <para style="s">Uhukumulhiya wa attu ikatema yo uwa wa Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Ashilhoko ihu, ninonshukuru Nlhuku ikatema chonkhaye wo nlhatu winyu. Iri yo ulhoka hii wiira chiicho ukhalhawaya nrima inyu unoothepa ukhomaalha chinene ni uttunana winyu unowunchereria chinene. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Ata hii vano ninowiititihacha mmilhokoni mwa attu a Nlhuku anrumelhenlhe Kuristo wo nlhatu winyu mwaatti, chinothepa inyu urumelhelha ni uvilhelha uhuva ni uttwaruwa wonkhaye unopatta inyu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Chechiyo chonkhaye chiyo phi nohimiechesha wiira uhukumulha wa Nlhuku uri we ikekhiaye ni wiira mmiholho mwaya nnoowa mwaaphwanelhiya ukelha mu Imwene aya unohuvelha inyu. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Nlhuku rii e ikekhiaye, noowa aatwarusha attu anoutwarushani mwaatti, <verse number="7" style="v"/>ni uvahani nipesha no wiittuwa mwaatti nnohuvihiya va. Ni hii ninoopangelhiya chiicho, Athithi Yesu vanohalha aya uwa ukhuma wiirimu vamoka ni minepa aya o wiirimu o machiri. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Vanowa aya anoowa waahukumulha ni nlhimi no mooro attu onkhaye anonkhota Nlhuku ni attu ahinrumelhelha Malhove Orera a Athithi Yesu. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Ulhakalhihiya waya unowa ukhalha wo mahuku o uhimalha, atiyelhelhiyaka wohoona Athithi wiitho ni uhoona nthimicho waya mulhupalhe. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Vanowa aya upochera nthimicho ukhuma wa attu aya ni nthimicho ukhuma wa attu anrumelhelha onkhaye, ni inyu chiicho nnowa ukhalha amoka aya, ukhalhawaya nhorumelhelha uhimiechesha wihu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Paahi etu ikatema chonkhaye ninoulhapelhelhani Nlhuku owooriheni uphwanelhiya ukhalha makhalhelho mwiihaniye inyu. Ninonlhapelha Nlhuku wo ikuru awe, atimirihe nnikwa inyu wo upanga chittu choombone ni umalhiha ntheko inyu wo upisha nrima. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Ninolhapelha wiira nchina na Athithi Yesu nithimichiye munlhokoni mwinyu ni inyu mpochere nthimicho ukhuma uwannyaya, wo nnema wa Nlhuku ni wa Athithi Yesu Kuristo.</para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">O uwonya mulhupalhe ulhe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Paahi vano ashilhoko ihu ulha phi mwaha unaacha uwa wa Athithi Yesu Kuristo irii uthukumaanihiya wihu vamoka. Mwaatti ninoushontelhelhani chinene, <verse number="2" style="v"/>wiira nhikelhiye nipampa chitemachitema mena nkamwaahiya nrima inyu, mena nhithuthushiye wo nnepa, mena wo nlhove, mena wo iwarakha inaanyiheriya ukhalha yawihu, thoko valhe nihuku ni Athithi nihaaya. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Ntu riyoothe huuthepiacheni ittu iriyoothe, ukhalhawaya nenno nihuku nno khaninowa mpaka uweeke Uhiiwananiya wulhupalhe wo unvinga Nlhuku ni O uhilhoka ulhe oonie kaye, nohalha umalhelha wo utanganyiya lhakalhaka. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Yoyo noowa aavinga kila ittu attu anaalhakelha aya ni wiihana milhuku ama anothimicha aya. Noowa wiichiinulha mwanene vachulhu kila ittu ata noowa aakelha ni ukhalha wi Inupa ya Nlhuku ni wiichihana Nlhuku.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Chani khannoopuwelha wiira kahouhimeriani mwaatti yayo malhove onkhaye ayo vaari aka ni inyu? <verse number="6" style="v"/>Nansho nhochuwelha ittu inonchiichiha vano iyo. Ikatema yaayakaru, yoyo ntu o uwonya uyo noowa oonia. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Ukhalhawaya machiri evinthe o yoyo O uhilhoka uyo ari munthekoni. Nansho khanoonia mpaka nonchiichiha uyo vanohalha awe uthamihiya. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Vavawo Yoyo o uwonya uyo phi nohalha awe upatakulhiya. Nansho Athithi Yesu vanowa aya, anowa aamwiiva wo Iphumu yo iyano aya ni umwiiva ni nchakarimia no uwa waya. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Yoyo O uwonya uyo noowa aawa ni machiri a Nakare ni upanga cho ushangiha ni ithikineha cho woothacha cho kila iphiro, <verse number="10" style="v"/>ni waathepiacha wo iphiro chinchi ampotera ayo, wo nlhatu wo ukhota urumelhelha ni uhittuna ikeekhene wiira oopolhiye akhalhe o ulhoka. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Nlhuku heesha yayo wuuthi machiri o muupoterani, arumelhelhe wiira athepiachiye. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Paahi attu onkhaye ahinorumelhelha ikeekhene, attapelhelhaka mwaha wo chittu cho unanara, anoowa yaahukumulhiya.</para>
  <para style="s">Nhothanlhiya wiira mwoopolhiye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Nansho vano hii ninshukuruku Nlhuku ikatema chonkhaye wo nlhatu winyu ashilhoko ihu nnottuniya ni Athithi. Ukhalhawaya toka varachi Nlhuku ahothanlhani wiira mwoopolhiye nkhalhe atakatifu wo machiri o Iphumu awe ni wo upishera nrima ikeekhene. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Nlhuku howiihanani mwaattiva wo Malhove Orera nihimianche ihu uwaninyu wiira mpatte vakittu munthimichoni mwa Athithi Yesu Kuristo. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Paahi etu, ashilhoko ihu mweemelheke rata, nhitikhinyiye, nvarechesheke meettuchiho mwiittuchihiye inyu ikhalhe wo malhove ama wo iwarakha chihu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Ninowaalhapelha Athithi Yesu Kuristo anene ni Nlhuku Athumwanihu anittunne ni wo nnema waya ahonivaha mpuha wo mahuku o uhimalha ni nikhulhuvelho no ikeekhene, <verse number="17" style="v"/>ohelhekeni nrima ni ulhipihani ikatema chonkhaye wo machiri o upanga mitheko ni wulhumacha chittu choombone.</para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Nnilhapelhelheke wa Nlhuku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Ashilhoko ihu, vanomalhiha ihu, nnilhapelhelheke, wiira nttenga wa Athithi uthepeke uwanelha chitema ni uthimichiya thoko chiri aya uwaninyu. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Tho munlhapelheke Nlhuku wiira anoopolhe mwa attu o uhilhoka apotenre, ukhalhawaya kahii attu onkhaye anorumelhelha ulha nttenga ulha.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Nansho Athithi arii o ukhulhuvelhiya. anoulhipihani ni uwiinkelhani nhivariye ni O uhilhoka ulhe. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Ni hii ninaakhulhuvelha Athithi wo nlhatu winyu mwaatti, nichuwelhaka chiicho wiira, nnoothepa upanga ittu ilhenhe ihu ilhe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Athithi aholhelheke mirima chinyu uuchuwelhani uttuna wa Nlhuku ni nrima wo uvilhelha ninovahiya ihu ni Kuristo.</para>
  <para style="s">Malhehero o uvara ntheko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Ashilhoko ihu, ninoulheherani wo nchina ni Athithi Yesu Kuristo wiira mwaashembeke ashilhoko inyu onkhaye o uhuva ni ahinotwara malhehero nilhehenre ihu. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Inyu mwaatti mwaashinene nhochuwelha rata iphiro inothananiya inyu unittwariha chipangilhe ihu. Ukhalhawaya vaari ihu uwaninyu, khanaakhanlhe wo ureshi, <verse number="8" style="v"/>mena khanaalhilhie ittu ya ntu riyoothe wo uhinlhiva. Nansho, uthana ni uhiyu nihuvaka nahovara ntheko wo uhoochaa wiira nihinrie nsigo ntu riyoothe. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Naapannge chiicho kuhii wiira khaniphwanelhiye uvahiya chittu ni inyu mwaatti, nansho naathanana uwiittuchihani wiira nnittwarihe. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Ukhalhawaya ata vaari ihu uwaninyu naari nilheheraka wiira, “Ntu riyoothe hinottuna uvara ntheko hilhie.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Nineera chiicho ukhalhawaya niheewa wiira munlhokoni mwinyu ahaawo areeshi ahinottuna uvara ntheko uriyoothe, nansho athemwaka uhimiacha chittu cha attu akina. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Paahi etu wo nchina ni Athithi Yesu Kuristo ninowaalhehera ni uwaamuka yayo attu ayo wiira eetimarikheke, avareke ntheko ni upatta ittu yo waalhamiha.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Ni inyu mwaatti chiicho, ashilhoko ihu, nhoochee upanga moombone. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Ni vavawo yakhalhaka wowo haawo ntu hinorumelhelha nlhove no ilha iwarakha ilha, munhimiacheke vaattuni yoyo ntu uyo, mena nhivaraanane, olhiye muru. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Nansho nhimwaalhakelhe thoko mmalhaponi nansho mmwaamukeke mmwoonaka ukhalha nlhoko inyu.</para>
  <para style="s">Malhove o umalhihera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Nlhuku mwanene nowiiha mpuha, ovaherekeni mpuha ikatema chonkhaye wo kila iphiro. Athithi akhalhe ni inyu mwaatti onkhaye.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Mii Paolo, kinouvahani isalamu chinolhepa aka wo moono aka kimwanene. Nenno phi nthonyero kinolhepa aka kila iwarakha. Chiichammo phi neera aka wo ulhepa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Nnema wa Athithi Yesu Kuristo ukhalhe vamoka ni inyu mwaatti onkhaye.</para>
</usx>
